WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,560 --> 00:00:01,840
I thought you were in danger

2
00:00:02,240 --> 00:00:04,760
I saw Zhang Lang when I was taking a shower. I'm sorry.

3
00:00:04,960 --> 00:00:06,480
I shouldn't have gone up there without investigating.

4
00:00:06,480 --> 00:00:07,720
I promised you not to go upstairs

5
00:00:14,840 --> 00:00:15,880
what happened tonight

6
00:00:15,880 --> 00:00:17,080
you are not allowed to tell anyone

7
00:00:17,240 --> 00:00:18,200
if you dare to say

8
00:00:18,480 --> 00:00:19,400
I'll kill you

9
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:21,080
You also give me yours tonight

10
00:00:21,080 --> 00:00:22,280
Completely forgotten what I saw

11
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:24,840
I must forget everything about it. Isn’t it good to hear it?

12
00:00:25,080 --> 00:00:26,000
from now on

13
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:27,800
You are not allowed to take another step on this staircase

14
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:30,120
Even if I die up there, you are not allowed to come up.

15
00:00:38,010 --> 00:00:38,930
Usually at this point

16
00:00:39,170 --> 00:00:40,890
He should have come down long ago to make bread and milk.

17
00:00:41,610 --> 00:00:42,970
It’s less than five minutes before and after

18
00:00:43,370 --> 00:00:44,610
Why haven't you come down yet today?

19
00:00:57,750 --> 00:00:59,230
I usually get down early at this time

20
00:00:59,700 --> 00:01:00,740
Why is it so late today?
